OL,3,AICE agent charged with lying about
OL,4,Ashooting Venezuelan man during
OL,5,Acrackdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US Immigration and Customs
OL,8,FEnforcement (ICE) agent has been
OL,9,Fcharged with lying about the non-fatal
OL,10,Fshooting of a Venezuelan migrant in the
OL,11,Fstate of Minnesota.
OL,13,FChristian Castro, who is not yet in
OL,14,Fcustody, faces a six-count federal
OL,15,Findictment relating to shooting on 14
OL,16,FJanuary, according to the BBC's US
OL,17,Fmedia partner CBS.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
