OL,3,AICE agent charged with lying about
OL,4,Ashooting Venezuelan man during
OL,5,Acrackdown
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Department of Homeland Security
OL,8,Finitially said he fired in self-defence
OL,9,Fafter being attacked by three
OL,10,FVenezuelan illegal migrants with a
OL,11,Fshovel and broom handle. Minnesota
OL,12,Finvestigators allege Castro fired
OL,13,Fthrough a closed door, shooting the man
OL,14,Fin the leg.
OL,16,FIt is rare for the current justice
OL,17,Fdepartment to accuse a federal agent of
OL,18,Fbreaking the law on the job.
